---
// Anatomy of a Go pprof Profile protobuf + safe /debug/pprof HTTP exposure & pprof.Do labels.
const W = 900;
const H = 278;
---
<figure class="ge7a">
  <div class="ge7a-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Inside a compressed pprof protobuf file mapping samples, stack locations, functions, and numeric values alongside safe production endpoint isolation.">
      {/* Left: pprof schema */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="444" height="250" rx="10" class="ge7a-card" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="ge7a-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Inside a gzipped pprof.Profile protobuf</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Cấu trúc file pprof nén (Sample + Stack + Value)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="60" width="412" height="58" rx="6" class="ge7a-box is-ok" />
      <text x="44" y="80" class="ge7a-b-ok">Sample[] — captured ~100 Hz (CPU) or per 512 KB (Heap)</text>
      <text x="44" y="98" class="ge7a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Stores [LocationID leaf..root] + Values [32ms] + Labels (tenant)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Lưu chuỗi [ID hàm từ ngọn → gốc] + giá trị [32ms] + nhãn label</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="130" width="198" height="56" rx="6" class="ge7a-box" />
      <text x="44" y="150" class="ge7a-b">Location[] &amp; Function[]</text>
      <text x="44" y="168" class="ge7a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Maps PC addr → file:line</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Ánh xạ địa chỉ → tên file:dòng</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="242" y="130" width="200" height="56" rx="6" class="ge7a-box" />
      <text x="256" y="150" class="ge7a-b">SampleType[] (Unit)</text>
      <text x="256" y="168" class="ge7a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>cpu/ns, alloc_space, inuse</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>cpu/ns, alloc_space, inuse</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="198" width="412" height="50" rx="6" class="ge7a-box" />
      <text x="44" y="219" class="ge7a-b">StringTable[] deduplication</text>
      <text x="44" y="236" class="ge7a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Strings are stored once by integer ID so profiles stay tiny.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Mọi tên hàm chỉ lưu đúng 1 lần theo ID số cho file cực nhẹ.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right: Production safety */}
      <rect x="476" y="14" width="410" height="250" rx="10" class="ge7a-card" />
      <text x="492" y="42" class="ge7a-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Safe production pprof exposure &amp; scoping</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Bật /debug/pprof an toàn trên server thật</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="492" y="60" width="378" height="60" rx="6" class="ge7a-box is-red" />
      <text x="506" y="80" class="ge7a-b-red">Do NOT attach _ "net/http/pprof" to port 8080</text>
      <text x="506" y="100" class="ge7a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Visitors could trigger 30s captures or DoS heap dumps.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Khách ngoài gọi liên tục có thể làm nghẽn CPU hoặc lộ dữ liệu.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="492" y="132" width="378" height="58" rx="6" class="ge7a-box is-ok" />
      <text x="506" y="152" class="ge7a-b-ok">Serve adminMux on internal :6060 only</text>
      <text x="506" y="170" class="ge7a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Explicit pprof.Index / pprof.Profile handlers inside VPC</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ gắn route pprof trên cổng nội bộ (adminMux :6060)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="492" y="202" width="378" height="46" rx="6" class="ge7a-box" />
      <text x="506" y="222" class="ge7a-b">Filter noisy workers via pprof.Do(ctx, labels, fn)</text>
      <text x="506" y="238" class="ge7a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Slice Flame Graphs by tenant, route, or worker type!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tách riêng Flame Graph theo endpoint, tenant hoặc job.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A pprof file compresses thousands of stack samples via integer-indexed string tables. Mount pprof handlers strictly on an internal admin port and tag hot code paths with pprof.Do for clean filtering.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Một file pprof gom hàng ngàn mẫu stack rất gọn nhờ bảng tra ID chuỗi. Trên production, nhớ mở cổng nội bộ riêng cho /debug/pprof và gắn pprof.Do để lọc đúng luồng chậm.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ge7a { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .ge7a-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ge7a svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .ge7a text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ge7a-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .ge7a-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .ge7a-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .ge7a-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge7a-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge7a-h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge7a-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge7a-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .ge7a-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge7a-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge7a-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .ge7a figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
